Cell["4. Named outliers", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3dd10128-c567-46af-b028-0bb70e357770"],

Cell["\<\
Class 1, maximal dimension: rule 254 (Boolean OR) grows a solid triangle, \
D=2, yet relaxes to a homogeneous fixed point. Class 3, D~1: rules 45/105/73 \
are chaotic on random ICs but grow a 1-D sliver from one seed. Class 2, \
D~1.97: rule 50 tiles space with a regular texture.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"98cf08cb-5bd5-4edf-87eb-fc5274601153"],

